node_modules/
dist/
.wrangler/
# Materialised copy of catalog-platform/packages/estate-auth (the canonical
# auth module). A build artifact of scripts/sync-estate-auth.mjs — never
# committed, because two copies of an auth file drift (estate-auth-design §1.1).
apps/worker/src/estate-auth/
# Materialised copy of catalog-platform's <estate-search> custom element (the
# canonical cross-catalog search box). A build artifact of
# scripts/sync-estate-search.mjs — never committed, so a search improvement made
# upstream reaches every site instead of dying in a per-repo fork.
apps/web/public/estate/
# Materialised copy of catalog-platform's estate THEME asset (estate-theme.css,
# theme.js, the self-hosted faces + their OFL text). A build artifact of
# scripts/sync-estate-theme.mjs — never committed, because the manual copy this
# replaces silently offered four themes for the whole day after `hearts`
# shipped upstream (2026-08-16). The whole directory is estate output; nothing
# hand-written has ever lived here. public/fonts/ is a DIFFERENT, older, still
# hand-maintained directory — do not confuse them.
apps/web/public/assets/
